From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tor-socks5 maintainers <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tor-guardmgr: retry re-enabled bridges and recover descriptors

Limit bridge descriptor recovery to the configured eligible set and retry bridges
that have been explicitly re-enabled, while retaining security-disabled state.

---
